  "body": "## What changed\n\nIssue #879 asked for the remaining user-facing \"setup furniture\" errors to be\nreworded and for the frame-watch clamp to be pinned.\n\n**Wording: no change needed on this base.** Re-checked on upstream/main\n(f490458a). No string literal in `crates/` says \"furniture\". The four\nmessages the issue cites already read:\n\n- `commands/repair_model.rs` (`not a model`): \"'...' is not a model - it is a setup's stock or work offset, a setup, a tool, an operation or other CAM data\" (was \"setup furniture\")\n- `commands/update_model.rs` (`not a model`): same text as above\n- `commands/tool.rs` (reserved name): \"'...' is a name reserved for a setup's stock and work offsets\"\n- `commands/setup.rs` (`:95`, `:109`): \"a setup name must not contain '/' - names with '/' are reserved for a setup's own stock and work offset\"; \"'...' is a name reserved for a setup's stock and work offsets\"\n\nThe existing guards already assert the absence of the word: `tests/repair_model.rs`\n(`!contains(\"furniture\")`) and `setup_refusals_never_say_furniture` in\n`tests/setups.rs` (#878).\n\n**Test hardening (the code change):** `FrameWatch::excuse` clamp case\n`an_excuse_is_clamped_to_the_time_since_the_last_mark` in\n`crates/ui/src/egui_app/frame_watch.rs`. A 200 ms commands phase, then\n`excuse(5 s)` at +210 ms, then `end` must still report \"slow frame 200 ms\"\nand `\"commands\" 200 ms`. Without the clamp the stamps move past `now`, the\nframe reads as 0 ms and `end` returns `None`, so the test fails.\n\nDecision recorded in `docs/decisions/879-furniture-wording.md` (a repo-wide\nsource scan for \"furniture\" was dropped: literals span lines and identifiers\nsit beside them, so it would need a lexer to avoid false positives).\n\n## Tests\n\n- `cargo xtask gate test an_excuse_is_clamped_to_the_time_since_the_last_mark --crate camcraft-ui`: ok\n- `cargo xtask gate quick --base upstream/main`: ok (ui lib, ui:boundary, ui:boundary_picks, ui:theme_files)\n- `cargo clippy -p camcraft-ui --all-targets -- -D warnings`: clean\n\n## Not exercised\n\n- The clamp test was not run against a clamp-less build (the failure was reasoned from the code, not observed).\n- No `cargo test -p camcraft-app` run: this branch changes no app code.\n- No snapshot PNG touched.\n\nChangelog: none (wording already shipped in #873/#875; test-only change)\n\nFork synced at v0.17.0\n\nFixes #879\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n",
